%%label I. Allegro di molto
%%note A minor. Jagged unisons, sudden hushes and rushing tremolos; the end dissolves towards F major for the slow movement.
X:1
T:C. P. E. Bach’s Missing Symphony
T:I. Allegro di molto
C:Claude (AI), in the manner of C. P. E. Bach
M:4/4
L:1/8
Q:"Allegro di molto" 1/4=126
%%score [fl ob bn] hn [v1 v2 va vc cb] hpd
% Original AI-composed homage. The score is written at sounding pitch.
